<section class="page-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THE DISTANCE BETWEEN YOU & YOUR CUSTOMER</p><div class="page-title-row"><h1>Good things.<br><em>On their way.</em></h1><p>You've done the making and the selling.<br>Let's talk about the part<br>that gets it there.</p></div></section>
<section class="delivery-band"><div class="wrap delivery-band-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">DELIVERY, WITH A LITTLE MORE CLARITY</p><h2>The last mile<br>is part of<br><em>the first impression.</em></h2><p>Your customer remembers how the order arrives. Clear details, thoughtful packaging, and a confirmed route make all the difference.</p><a href="/reach-out?topic=Delivery" class="button button-dark">Talk delivery with us <?= icon('arrow-up-right') ?></a></div><img src="/assets/images/packing.jpg" alt="A retailer carefully checking and preparing a customer's parcel" width="1400" height="935"></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM CHECKOUT TO KNOCK AT THE DOOR</p><h2>Every parcel<br><em>has a journey.</em></h2></div><p>Know the steps.<br>Set the right expectations.</p></div><div class="delivery-steps"><article><?= icon('shopping-bag') ?><span>01</span><h3>Order details, sorted.</h3><p>Confirm the products, payment, customer number, and delivery address. A clear start avoids a complicated finish.</p></article><article><?= icon('package') ?><span>02</span><h3>Packed and ready.</h3><p>Check the items, protect anything fragile, and label the parcel. Let us know about special handling.</p></article><article><?= icon('truck') ?><span>03</span><h3>A route that fits.</h3><p>Pickup and delivery depend on location, parcel size, and availability. Confirm the quote and timing before dispatch.</p></article><article><?= icon('circle-check') ?><span>04</span><h3>A proper handover.</h3><p>Keep your customer informed and confirm the delivery. Clear communication belongs at every step.</p></article></div></section>
